    "body": "Stacked on NVIDIA/Megatron-LM#7502.\n\n## Summary\n- Keep dispatcher rows for padded tokens, zero their routing probabilities, and exclude them from load-balancing counters.\n- Reuse the regular MoE checkpoint path for selective recompute in the modality MoE layer.\n- Skip expert-bias collectives when the update rate is zero.\n- Add unit tests in `tests/unit_tests/models/test_deepseek_v41_components.py`.",
    "changed_files": 5,
