      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "@guihong-nv This is a follow-up PR on top of #7502. It fixes padded-token routing by keeping their dispatcher rows while zeroing their probs and leaving them out of the balance counters. It also reuses the regular MoE checkpoint path for selective recompute and skips expert-bias collectives when the update rate is 0. Verified together with https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Megatron-Bridge/pull/6199. Please let me know if you have any comments.",
